WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:02.580
[GARP] Lesson one.

3
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:07.050
An old man and a baby are stranded
on an island full of deadly predators.

4
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:11.810
You sail to the island to save them,
but only one person other than you can fit

5
00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:13.020
on your rescue boat.

6
00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.360
What are you gonna do?

7
00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.920
<b>Former
Marine Headquarters</b>

8
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:18.540
[KOBY] Umm. Oh, I get it!

9
00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:21.610
Okay! I'll get off
the boat and stay there.

10
00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.480
Then the baby
and old man will fit.

11
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.020
That would save them both!

12
00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.180
No, idiot!

13
00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.350
Wrong answer!

14
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.780
[chuckles]

15
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.340
The old geezer's gonna
die soon anyway.

16
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.390
So abandon him!

17
00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:36.640
[MARINE STUDENTS] What?

18
00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.700
Vice Admiral!
Don't tell them that!

19
00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:41.140
[GARP] Think hard.

20
00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.980
Why are you boys
here in the first place?

21
00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.800
[GARP]
Why did you join the Navy?

22
00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:51.430
There's something out there
worth protecting, right?

23
00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:53.500
So what is it?

24
00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:31.130
<b>The Final Lesson</b>

25
00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:37.140
[FULLBODY] How did
they get so banged up?

26
00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:41.890
<b>Ship Graveyard
Near Marine Base G-1</b>

27
00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:40.310
[DJANGO] Maybe a run-in
with some really nasty pirates?

28
00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:41.270
[BRANNEW] Not quite.

29
00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:42.240
Huh?

30
00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.510
I guess you've never
heard of Battleship Bags.

31
00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.420
[DJANGO]
Commodore Brannew!

32
00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.270
[FULLBODY] What
are Battleship Bags?

33
00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.110
You see those
indentations there?

34
00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.970
Those are fist marks
from someone

35
00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:54.690
using the armor of the warships
as punching bags.

36
00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.210
[DJANGO, FULLBODY]
Punching bags?!

37
00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:57.640
[FULLBODY] Do you
know who did it?

38
00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:01.640
Vice Admiral Garp,
starting when he was young.

39
00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:04.790
He's kept it up for decades
now. It's his routine.

40
00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:05.940
[DJANGO] He's still doing it?!

41
00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.320
[FULLBODY] Why are
there two of them?

42
00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:09.660
The other belonged
to Garp's protégé.

43
00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.550
The former admiral, Aokiji.

44
00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:16.250
[BRANNEW] You can't use
haki or devil fruit powers.

45
00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:18.440
That's the rule
of Battleship Bagging.

46
00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:20.640
This is the strength
of a true hero.

47
00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.810
It's not something
you're born with.

48
00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:27.610
Ooooooooooh!

49
00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:30.590
Uuugh!

50
00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:43.540
[WOLF yells]

51
00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:51.210
That punch sent him flying
straight into the sea!

52
00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:54.170
Garp's a monster!

53
00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:02.560
<b>Beehive, Pirate Island
New World</b>

54
00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:02.030
[PIRATE D] Quick! We gotta pull
him out or he's gonna drown!

55
00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.460
[PIRATE E] How the hell are
we supposed to do that?

56
00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.840
He beat the boss in one shot!

57
00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:10.240
We can't fight this guy!

58
00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.730
Thank you so much,
Vice Admiral!

59
00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:15.220
That's the Legendary
Hero for ya!

60
00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.630
Save it, boys.
I'm just gettin' started!

61
00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:20.500
[GARP laughs]

62
00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.930
[VASCO chuckles]

63
00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:24.300
[VASCO] "Legendary
Hero," my ass.

64
00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:29.360
You're nothin' but an old hack
who's been trashin' our hideout.

65
00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:33.610
And now we're gonna make
ya pay for the damages.

66
00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.510
[VASCO] Drunken Spitfire!

67
00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:53.590
[GARP] Pirate Fireballs!

68
00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.370
[PIRATES yell]

69
00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:56.890
[yells]

70
00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.730
[PIRATES yell]

71
00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:03.940
[PIRATES scream]

72
00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:09.770
[PIZARRO] Meowch!
That's hot! Stop burning me!

73
00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.660
[yells]

74
00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.080
[PIZARRO] Are you trying
to sink the whole island?

75
00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:22.210
Calm down, you maniac!

76
00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:25.320
What are we gonna do when
Commodore Teach comes back?

77
00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:28.380
If he sees his base like
this, he'll kill us all!

78
00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.270
[laughs]

79
00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.240
[PIRATE I] We got
Garp outnumbered,

80
00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:37.940
and he doesn't even flinch,
what's wrong with him?

81
00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.900
[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A ringing]

82
00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.320
[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A]
Cu-lick.

83
00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.080
[KUJAKU] We're in the clear,
Vice Admiral!

84
00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.480
The prisoners, our soldiers,

85
00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:47.240
and all the injured have been
evacuated from the island.

86
00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.680
They're all aboard
the ship now.

87
00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.470
[GARP] Good. Nice work.

88
00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:53.920
Hibari! Stay strong!

89
00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:57.120
Watch the frozen ones!
Thaw them slowly!

90
00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.560
Captain Koby. Please be safe.

91
00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:01.650
We're ready to set
off at any time!

92
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.170
Okay! We're all done here!

93
00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:09.010
Pull back! Koby!
Helmeppo! Grus, c'mon!

94
00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:09.740
Right!

95
00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:11.830
On my way!

96
00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.270
I won't miss this hellhole,
that's for sure!

97
00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:21.630
This place sure
lives up to the talk.

98
00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:22.880
You poke a hole anywhere

99
00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.560
and these damn pirates
swarm out, one after another.

100
00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.010
[PIRATES chuckle]

101
00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.940
[PIRATE O snarls]

102
00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:31.370
[GARP] Hm?

103
00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:39.000
I'm sorry Garp, but like I
said, I can't let you leave.

104
00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:40.600
Get ready.

105
00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.440
I should've run while
I still had the chance!

106
00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.240
Aw, jeez. I'm dead!

107
00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:49.240
Before we fight,
I'm your favorite, too, right?

108
00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:52.050
You sure you want
to do this, Kuzan?

109
00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.910
All of Blackbeard's
officers are dangerous.

110
00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:55.950
Be careful!

111
00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.590
We don't have to beat them!

112
00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:02.440
All we gotta do is drag
our asses to the coast!

113
00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.250
Don't let 'em kill you.

114
00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:06.520
[ALL] Yes, sir!

115
00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.440
[WOMAN A screams]

116
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.000
Somebody, help me!

117
00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:17.880
Oh, no! I must have left
one of the prisoners behind!

118
00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:19.370
I'm on my way, ma'am!

119
00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.260
[KOBY] Thank goodness we
didn't set sail without her!

120
00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:25.590
Koby, wait!
Don't go! It's a trap!

121
00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.540
[BOTH laugh]

122
00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:30.410
[groans]

123
00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:45.370
Vice Admiral Garp!

124
00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:54.630
[yells]

125
00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:56.090
[ALL gasps]

126
00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:59.180
Bastard!

127
00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.490
Oh...

128
00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:05.970
What? Was he
invisible somehow?

129
00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:07.430
[GARP] Shiryu.

130
00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:10.510
I think Impel Down was
a better fit for you.

131
00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.850
[chuckles]

132
00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.780
[PIRATE O] Woo!
Shiryu got him!

133
00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:25.020
[PIRATE P] He ran that sword
straight through Iron Garp!

134
00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:28.390
[GRUS] You okay, Garp?!

135
00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:32.270
I'll be fine! Just get
back to the ship!

136
00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.900
This is all my fault!
He got hurt defending me!

137
00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:43.910
Don't flatter yourself, Koby!
I was his target all along.

138
00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:55.370
Don't give up easy,
do you, old man?

139
00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:57.550
Looks like Garp's worn down.

140
00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:00.990
[PIRATE R] Shiryu was just
waiting to make his move!

141
00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:04.040
Even normal guys like us
can take him down now!

142
00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.560
– Let's go!
– [PIRATE U] Yeah!

143
00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:07.990
[PIRATES yell]

144
00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:09.950
[PIRATE W] All we gotta
do is finish the old man off

145
00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:11.750
and we'll be set for life!

146
00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.210
[PIRATE X] Hurry! Hurry!

147
00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:14.920
Garp is worth as
much as an admiral!

148
00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.130
He's got a Three-Crown
Bounty! Heh!

149
00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.370
That's like three billion berries!

150
00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.250
[GARP] Huh?

151
00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.440
Oh yeah!

152
00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.980
[AOKIJI] Outta
my way, small fries!

153
00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:40.530
[PIRATE AA] Wait!

154
00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:47.400
[AOKIJI] Even if his hands
and feet were tied together,

155
00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.650
you still couldn't kill Garp!

156
00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:50.750
[chuckles]

157
00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.690
[AOKIJI] Leave this to me!

158
00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.150
Huh?

159
00:09:58.770 --> 00:09:59.660
Ice Glove!

160
00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:09.550
[AOKIJI] Hey, Garp.

161
00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:15.840
[AOKIJI] I want
you to mentor me.

162
00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.660
Are you being serious?

163
00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:20.790
I am.

164
00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:24.840
[GARP] Nah, I like my freedom.
Go bother one of the trainers.

165
00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.550
They've taught
me all they can.

166
00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:29.580
I'm ready for more.
Please, teach me.

167
00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:32.960
I said no! Get lost!

168
00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.960
[AOKIJI sighs]

169
00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.930
[GARP] Hm?

170
00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:49.100
[AOKIJI] Ow!
Damn, that hurts.

171
00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.740
[GARP] You better
not use haki!

172
00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:56.110
That won't help ya learn.

173
00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.770
I don't even know
how to do that yet.

174
00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:04.960
Agh! Let's do this!

175
00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:10.090
[AOKIJI yelling]

176
00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:11.750
[chuckles]

177
00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:20.640
[banging]

178
00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:43.900
[AOKIJI] What is
"justice" to the Navy?

179
00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:49.370
I don't even know anymore.
Not after Ohara.

180
00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:53.040
[GARP yells]

181
00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:57.110
[GARP] My son became
a Revolutionary!

182
00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:58.310
Huh?

183
00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.890
Damn it!

184
00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:13.720
[GARP] Kuzan!

185
00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.400
What's wrong with you?

186
00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:18.520
[GARP] My grandson says he
wants to be a damned pirate!

187
00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.030
Why the hell
would he do that?

188
00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:22.620
Well, I have no idea!

189
00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:25.110
[GARP] I gotta eat something.
Wanna join me?

190
00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:28.960
[AOKIJI] I have work to do.
Did you forget I'm an admiral?

191
00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.230
– Tea?
– [AOKIJI] Come on.

192
00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.410
[laughs]

193
00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:35.420
[groans]

194
00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:40.780
You trained a powerful
enemy for yourself.

195
00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.860
You're expelled. You dunce.

196
00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.530
Vice Admiral, no!

197
00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:24.310
[GRUS] Garp!

198
00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:26.140
Taught him well after all.

199
00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.080
[PIRATES laughing]

200
00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.790
Keep him safe,
no matter what!

201
00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:31.710
Right!

202
00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:33.550
[PIZARRO laughs]

203
00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:34.620
[PIZARRO] Every
second you stay here,

204
00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.150
your odds get
worse and worse!

205
00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.670
This is Pirate Island after all!

206
00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:43.090
They're gonna keep comin'
till you're "full-a-lead"!

207
00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:47.800
You think I can't sink my claws into that
ship you've got waiting off the coast?

208
00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:52.020
You think I can't sink my claws into that
ship you've got waiting off the coast?

209
00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.800
Allow me to demonstrate
the power of my Isle-Isle Fruit.

210
00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.250
Are you all right?

211
00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.770
Take it slow. You're safe now.

212
00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:04.920
Where is Koby? Please
tell me he made it out!

213
00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.960
I'm sorry. I caused you
all so much trouble. Huh?

214
00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:13.380
He'll be with us soon.
And you're never trouble.

215
00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:25.130
[gasps]

216
00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.670
Captain! We've got trouble!

217
00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:30.710
[PIZARRO] All you
see in the papers

218
00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:33.630
is "Blackbeard this"
and "Blackbeard that."

219
00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.530
Well, meow you'll
see what I can do!

220
00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:41.240
Let me give you a sneak preview
of tomorrow's big news story!

221
00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.860
"The famous Vice
Admiral Garp

222
00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.900
led a team of promising
young elites

223
00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.440
in an attack on Pirate Island!"

224
00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.280
They attempted
to rescue Captain Koby,

225
00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:52.870
the hero of the Navy!"

226
00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:56.230
Hmph.

227
00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.380
[screams]

228
00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.770
"But then the Fourth
Ship Captain

229
00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:28.150
of the Blackbeard Pirates struck
and they bowed before him!

230
00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:32.540
The Great Avalo Pizarro
proved far too mighty!

231
00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:37.040
And all of those poor,
brave Marines

232
00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:40.390
were completely annihilated"!

233
00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:45.900
[PIZARRO laughs]

234
00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.800
[KOBY] No, please!
Don't do this!

235
00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.860
There are civilians on board!

236
00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:52.040
Those people aren't
your enemies!

237
00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:53.820
Calm down, Koby.

238
00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:57.580
[GARP] Mark my words, boy.

239
00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.770
Justice will prevail!

240
00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:09.200
<b>A Few Weeks Ago

Amazon Lily, the Isle of Women</b>

241
00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.320
Let's go!

242
00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:17.100
Let's have some fun.

243
00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.980
[laughs]

244
00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:21.380
[PIRATE B] Walk faster!

245
00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:24.590
[MARINE C] Don't do
this! Please, let us go!

246
00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.890
[MARINE D] You're taking us
to Pirate Island, aren't you?

247
00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:28.580
What are you
gonna do to us?

248
00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:32.000
[TEACH laughs]

249
00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.890
Didn't think Rayleigh would stick
his nose in my business.

250
00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:39.330
But I got some nice
souvenirs, so who cares?

251
00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:42.460
[TEACH laughs]

252
00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:44.380
[MARINE E] Vice Admiral,
they're our comrades!

253
00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:45.740
Can't we do anything?

254
00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.960
[MARINE M] We're
letting our men down.

255
00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:50.420
[YAMAKAJI] We need
permission from above.

256
00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:52.550
Blackbeard is an Emperor.

257
00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.660
[MARINE F] I know, but...

258
00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:04.210
[laughs]

259
00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:02.590
What is he doing?

260
00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.650
Vice Admiral, Captain
Koby is with SWORD.

261
00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:13.370
SWORD, huh?

262
00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:16.050
Well, if it isn't Koby the Hero!

263
00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:20.330
So what, y'come here
to take your friends back?

264
00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:24.540
If you want to start an all-out war,
that's just peachy with me.

265
00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.450
You're capturing 800 Marines

266
00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:29.800
and also commandeering
one of our warships, right?

267
00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:34.260
Let them go. And you
can take me instead.

268
00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:43.890
[laughs]

269
00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:47.440
You think pretty highly
of yourself, don't you, kid?

270
00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:51.740
But your life is worth it.
You got a deal.

271
00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:58.230
How is this even real?

272
00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:04.800
[HELMEPPO] It's too huge!
We can't fight that thing!

273
00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:07.150
<b>Present Day

Beehive, Pirate Island</b>

274
00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:14.920
What is that?
You're kiddin' me!

275
00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:17.370
Open fire!

276
00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:24.640
Open fire!

277
00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:30.510
It's no use. It isn't stopping!

278
00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:33.820
We have to pull away.
Move the ship back!

279
00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:38.390
[PIZARRO] Huh?
Not on my watch!

280
00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.080
It can still reach us!

281
00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:47.440
<b>On Pirate Island</b>

282
00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:44.650
It can...

283
00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.720
[KOBY] Oh, no.

284
00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:52.720
If that hand comes
down on them,

285
00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:55.710
hundreds of soldiers
and civilians will die!

286
00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:58.940
We can't fight it! Where
would we even start?

287
00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:03.020
Call everyone up to the deck!
Prepare to abandon ship!

288
00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:04.850
Keep the civilians safe!

289
00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.510
This is all my fault!

290
00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:09.730
Everyone here is going
to die because of me!

291
00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.600
[KOBY] I surrendered myself
to protect my comrades.

292
00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:19.560
But all I've done is put
more people in danger!

293
00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:22.420
I can't protect anyone!

294
00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:29.500
[KOBY yells]

295
00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.470
What are you talking about!

296
00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:37.130
I can't do this!

297
00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:41.190
You can do it.

298
00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:46.930
[GARP] You can save them.

299
00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.530
[gasps]

300
00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:51.280
Vice Admiral Garp?

301
00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:54.950
[PIRATES yelling]

302
00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:58.840
Stay calm. I've got a plan.

303
00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.620
[MARINES yell]

304
00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.960
[GARP] I'll create
an opening for you.

305
00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:06.760
First, Captain Koby,

306
00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:11.310
you climb up to that big rock
bastard's hand and destroy it.

307
00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:14.110
What? But how
can I do that?

308
00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:15.640
Rear Admiral Grus,

309
00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:20.200
when pieces of the hand fall
down, you protect the ship.

310
00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:21.970
Lieutenant Commander
Helmeppo,

311
00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:24.350
don't let anyone
stand in their way!

312
00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:25.690
I-I can try.

313
00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:29.120
Vice Admiral, wait!
What if I can't...?

314
00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:31.240
[GARP] Hesitation
means defeat!

315
00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:34.630
Go!

316
00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:45.240
[ALL] Yes, sir!

317
00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:54.440
Koby and the others
are on the move!

318
00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.950
[PIRATES yelling, laughing]

319
00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:57.030
[PIRATE E] Give it up!

320
00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:00.800
Without Garp, you're all
going straight into the sea!

321
00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:04.440
They're coming!

322
00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:06.380
Helmeppo! Go get 'em!

323
00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.710
Huh? Why me?

324
00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.630
Because those
were your orders!

325
00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:14.140
Fine, then. But I don't like it!

326
00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:16.110
Let's see what you've got!

327
00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:17.460
Huh?

328
00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:20.910
That's a lot of pirates!
Uh, one at a time, please!

329
00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:23.410
C'mon, Koby.
What's the plan here?

330
00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:25.120
You have a bomb
or something?

331
00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:26.520
I've got nothing!

332
00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:28.590
I'll just have to play
it by ear for now!

333
00:21:28.670 --> 00:21:30.110
Wait, "play it by ear"?

334
00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:32.560
You can't just "play it by ear"
fighting something big enough

335
00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:34.280
to crush a damn warship!

336
00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:35.560
Trust me, I know!

337
00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:44.190
Burn in hell, Koby!

338
00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:39.950
Dammit.

339
00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:44.410
[HELMEPPO] Koby...

340
00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:46.950
[GARP] Lieutenant
Commander Helmeppo,

341
00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:49.410
don't let anyone
stand in their way.

342
00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:50.950
Here I go!

343
00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:56.630
[HELMEPPO] The rest...
is up to you.

344
00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:58.500
[HELMEPPO] Get back!

345
00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:02.400
Helmeppo, no!

346
00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:04.840
Don't look back! Just go!

347
00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:07.640
– But I...!
– You have a job to do!

348
00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:16.690
[AOKIJI] I'd sit back
down if I were you, Garp.

349
00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:22.150
Keep movin'
and you'll bleed out.

350
00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:24.900
[chuckles] This is just
a scratch.

351
00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:29.440
[yells]

352
00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:32.260
[AOKIJI] I'm tryin'
to spare your life.

353
00:22:32.730 --> 00:22:34.410
Sounds soft to me.

354
00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:37.120
What?

355
00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:40.890
[yells]

356
00:22:56.480 --> 00:22:57.280
Gaaah!

357
00:22:57.170 --> 00:22:59.220
[PIZARRO] Uh... Huh?

358
00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:09.140
[PIZARRO] Garp!
What're you doing here?

359
00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:12.690
Wait! Don't you care
what'll happen to the ship?

360
00:23:12.690 --> 00:23:19.400
Galaxy... Divide!

361
00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:33.120
Gaaaaaah!

362
00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:37.950
[PIZARRO yells]

363
00:23:39.860 --> 00:23:43.400
Wait, what happened?
It's pulling back!

364
00:23:46.060 --> 00:23:48.960
No! No! No!

365
00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:54.080
So this is your opening, huh?
The arm went up. What now, Koby?

366
00:23:58.650 --> 00:24:00.000
Okay. Here I go!

367
00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:04.030
Koby!

368
00:24:07.580 --> 00:24:11.700
[PIZARRO] Oh,
meow you've done it!

369
00:24:14.290 --> 00:24:17.320
[PIZARRO] You think
that's enough to stop me?

370
00:24:17.320 --> 00:24:25.050
Ha! I'll make you pay! Stand
back and watch me do this!

371
00:24:25.370 --> 00:24:27.720
I'll send your men
to their graves!

372
00:24:28.260 --> 00:24:31.430
And there's nothing
you can do about it!

373
00:24:31.430 --> 00:24:33.280
It's back. Take cover!

374
00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:37.230
[PIZARRO] You can cry all you
like, but we've already won!

375
00:24:39.000 --> 00:24:40.360
[GARP] Hey, Helmeppo.

376
00:24:40.620 --> 00:24:42.540
Koby's making good progress,

377
00:24:42.540 --> 00:24:45.370
but why the hell's
he always injured?

378
00:24:45.560 --> 00:24:46.720
[HELMEPPO] You
noticed, huh?

379
00:24:46.910 --> 00:24:52.120
Oh, well... He said not to tell
you, but I guess I'd better.

380
00:25:00.360 --> 00:25:02.530
[KOBY] I can't fight as
well as everyone else,

381
00:25:02.610 --> 00:25:05.230
even if I train ten times
as much as them.

382
00:25:05.280 --> 00:25:08.650
So I'll train a hundred...
no, 200 times harder!

383
00:25:08.650 --> 00:25:11.770
If that's what it takes to be
a proper Marine to help people,

384
00:25:11.770 --> 00:25:14.780
then I'll do it!

385
00:25:15.430 --> 00:25:18.190
[KOBY screams]

386
00:25:21.420 --> 00:25:24.590
[HELMEPPO] That's enough!
Don't be stupid!

387
00:25:24.990 --> 00:25:27.030
You're gonna
destroy yourself!

388
00:25:27.370 --> 00:25:28.740
[GARP] You're telling me

389
00:25:28.830 --> 00:25:32.250
he's been training by
himself on top of my drills?

390
00:25:32.250 --> 00:25:35.470
[HELMEPPO] Yes, sir. He's been
punching the Battleship Bag,

391
00:25:35.470 --> 00:25:38.300
every single night.

392
00:25:42.150 --> 00:25:42.950
Yep.

393
00:25:44.860 --> 00:25:48.750
[HELMEPPO] And he comes back
with his fists covered in blood.

394
00:25:57.950 --> 00:26:01.950
[KOBY] Faster! Go faster!

395
00:26:02.080 --> 00:26:03.670
I have to make it in time!

396
00:26:10.020 --> 00:26:11.040
[HIBARI] Is that...

397
00:26:14.640 --> 00:26:15.470
[HIBARI] Koby!

398
00:26:16.370 --> 00:26:19.370
Hey! What are you doing?

399
00:26:20.330 --> 00:26:22.330
Hold on. That's Koby!

400
00:26:22.700 --> 00:26:24.740
Is he really trying
to stop the hand?

401
00:26:24.860 --> 00:26:26.380
He's gonna get crushed!

402
00:26:26.460 --> 00:26:28.580
I know they call him
a hero, but look!

403
00:26:28.580 --> 00:26:32.180
Next to Pizarro, the kid
is like the size of an ant!

404
00:26:32.180 --> 00:26:33.200
Koby, why?

405
00:26:33.780 --> 00:26:36.490
Just protect yourself!
Don't worry about us!

406
00:26:36.620 --> 00:26:38.520
Get away! Go back!

407
00:26:38.520 --> 00:26:40.370
[laughs]

408
00:26:40.370 --> 00:26:43.000
Hey, Koby! You made it!

409
00:26:43.010 --> 00:26:46.580
You got a front row seat
to the death of all your friends!

410
00:26:46.660 --> 00:26:51.080
Even if they dive into the sea,
Aokiji will freeze them solid!

411
00:26:51.080 --> 00:26:53.050
[MARINES scream]

412
00:26:53.080 --> 00:26:55.860
[PIZARRO] Time to take
out the kitty litter!

413
00:27:00.430 --> 00:27:02.710
[KOBY] Everyone's lives
are depending on me.

414
00:27:08.330 --> 00:27:09.840
[KOBY] I have to destroy it!

415
00:27:10.280 --> 00:27:12.880
If I don't, they'll all die!

416
00:27:13.430 --> 00:27:16.110
I can't fight as well
as everyone else,

417
00:27:16.110 --> 00:27:19.570
even if I train ten
times as hard.

418
00:27:25.010 --> 00:27:30.310
[KOBY] So I trained
a hundred...200 times harder!

419
00:27:30.570 --> 00:27:33.480
[GARP] There's something out
there worth protecting, right?

420
00:27:33.560 --> 00:27:35.150
So what is it?

421
00:27:36.770 --> 00:27:38.050
Koby!

422
00:27:38.050 --> 00:27:42.250
It's too late! Abandon ship!

423
00:27:44.240 --> 00:27:45.840
[GARP] You can save them.

424
00:27:54.360 --> 00:28:00.440
Honesty Impact!

425
00:28:31.380 --> 00:28:36.220
[laughing]

426
00:28:36.220 --> 00:28:38.680
Damn, Koby. What was that?

427
00:28:41.440 --> 00:28:42.140
We're saved!

428
00:28:42.430 --> 00:28:44.890
No, not yet! There's
too much debris!

429
00:28:44.890 --> 00:28:49.030
[MARINES scream]

430
00:28:49.030 --> 00:28:52.740
That's why I'm here!
Glorp Web!

431
00:28:54.880 --> 00:28:56.290
[gasps]

432
00:28:59.040 --> 00:29:02.530
There you go!

433
00:29:04.450 --> 00:29:08.070
Koby! Hey!

434
00:29:11.040 --> 00:29:14.660
Koby! I don't even
know what to say!

435
00:29:16.210 --> 00:29:20.300
Hey, Helmeppo. I did it.

436
00:29:23.670 --> 00:29:28.800
Yeah, you did, buddy!
You were amazing!

437
00:29:29.050 --> 00:29:30.340
Look at you,

438
00:29:30.420 --> 00:29:33.780
strong enough to bring
down a mountain!

439
00:29:37.820 --> 00:29:40.580
Let's go home, you maniac!

440
00:29:47.190 --> 00:29:48.710
[MARINE J] Captain Koby!

441
00:29:48.710 --> 00:29:50.010
[MARINE K] Helmeppo!

442
00:29:50.190 --> 00:29:52.090
[MARINE L] Welcome
back, you two!

443
00:29:52.570 --> 00:29:53.770
Koby, you're alive!

444
00:29:56.070 --> 00:29:58.660
[KOBY] Hibari.

445
00:29:58.660 --> 00:30:03.450
You're okay.
We're all going home.

446
00:30:05.090 --> 00:30:08.640
Okay. Once Garp is
back, we'll take off.

447
00:30:09.100 --> 00:30:13.350
[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A ringing]

448
00:30:13.570 --> 00:30:13.770
[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A]
Cu-lick.

449
00:30:13.770 --> 00:30:15.870
[GARP] This is Garp.

450
00:30:16.930 --> 00:30:19.970
The mission to rescue
Captain Koby is a success.

451
00:30:20.100 --> 00:30:23.020
Vice Admiral. You're all right!

452
00:30:23.210 --> 00:30:25.500
Hurry back to the ship
and we'll leave.

453
00:30:25.800 --> 00:30:30.430
[GARP] Actually... depart
from Fullalead immediately.

454
00:30:30.450 --> 00:30:33.030
That's an order.

455
00:30:33.030 --> 00:30:34.050
[KOBY] What?

456
00:30:34.220 --> 00:30:36.180
Vice Admiral, what are
you talking about?

457
00:30:36.260 --> 00:30:38.910
Don't you worry
about this old man.

458
00:30:38.920 --> 00:30:40.580
Our top priority in this mission

459
00:30:40.580 --> 00:30:43.650
is the safety of everyone
on that ship.

460
00:30:44.170 --> 00:30:45.350
Am I wrong?

461
00:30:50.430 --> 00:30:51.580
We can't go.

462
00:30:51.590 --> 00:30:54.590
Hurry! Turn the ship around!

463
00:30:54.590 --> 00:30:57.050
[GARP] We've won
the battle today.

464
00:30:57.130 --> 00:31:00.490
Our victory sends
a message to all pirates.

465
00:31:04.540 --> 00:31:07.140
Please you have to let
me join the Marines.

466
00:31:07.220 --> 00:31:09.880
I'll clean and scrub and do any
chores that you'd like me to.

467
00:31:09.960 --> 00:31:12.050
I'll do anything
to become a Marine.

468
00:31:13.910 --> 00:31:16.940
[GARP] What did you boys
join the Navy to protect?

469
00:31:17.050 --> 00:31:18.850
Huh?

470
00:31:19.120 --> 00:31:21.200
It's the future of all
people, right?

471
00:31:21.510 --> 00:31:24.540
You'll be part of that
future for years to come,

472
00:31:24.540 --> 00:31:27.660
long after the old man's gone.

473
00:31:27.660 --> 00:31:33.880
Take that baby and go.
Live your lives.

474
00:31:51.000 --> 00:31:52.330
[GARP] Keep going.

475
00:31:52.410 --> 00:31:56.100
You all are the future
of the Navy.

476
00:31:56.800 --> 00:31:58.280
Don't look back!

477
00:31:58.880 --> 00:32:00.880
[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A]
Ca-lick.

478
00:32:00.940 --> 00:32:05.940
[laughing]

479
00:32:09.490 --> 00:32:10.840
[HOTOTOGISU] What
were you thinking?

480
00:32:11.060 --> 00:32:13.560
In the future, will you please
limit the tasteless lectures

481
00:32:13.600 --> 00:32:15.360
in front of the young recruits?

482
00:32:15.360 --> 00:32:19.230
Hmph. Why should I, when young
people's future is limitless?

483
00:32:19.230 --> 00:32:23.860
[GARP laughing]

484
00:32:25.620 --> 00:32:30.620
[GARP laughing]

485
00:32:32.250 --> 00:32:34.670
[NARRATOR] The next day,
newspapers reported

486
00:32:34.670 --> 00:32:38.920
the heroic rescue of the Navy's
young hero, Captain Koby.

487
00:32:38.920 --> 00:32:42.380
Along with the sorrowful
news that Vice Admiral Garp

488
00:32:42.380 --> 00:32:45.840
disappeared after
his battle on Pirate Island.

489
00:32:45.840 --> 00:32:49.060
It was also reported that
the Emperor of the Sea,

490
00:32:49.060 --> 00:32:51.980
Straw Hat Luffy,
had barricaded himself

491
00:32:51.980 --> 00:32:55.560
on the Future
Island, Egghead.

492
00:32:54.700 --> 00:33:00.000
"Straw Hat..."
